#: ../../tools/smolagent_tools.rst:63 46b4d750cdf24f3084ecb714b51651ac
msgid ""
"**Description**: Research manager agent that decomposes the user task, "
"delegates focused subtasks to domain sub‑agents (web researcher, "
"synthesizer), enforces evidence use, requires numeric outputs with units,"
" and returns a concise final answer with citations. It should: (1) draft "
"a brief plan, (2) ask web\\_researcher to gather authoritative facts "
"(URLs + extracted numbers), (3) validate consistency across sources, (4) "
"instruct synthesizer to compute/compose the final result, and (5) output "
"only the final, unit‑aware answer plus one short rationale line."
msgstr ""

